{"id":7018,"date":"2020-03-03T22:06:01","date_gmt":"2020-03-04T03:06:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7018"},"modified":"2020-03-03T21:54:53","modified_gmt":"2020-03-04T02:54:53","slug":"making-progress","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/03\/03\/making-progress\/","title":{"rendered":"Making Progress"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Were doing a lot better than this trucker we saw today.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7013\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_103556-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>On I-10, crossed the median and rolled.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>It was raining almost as soon as we pulled out of Deming, NM and still hasn&#8217;t totally stopped now in Sonora, TX.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We came across this poor soul that I&#8217;m assuming just didn&#8217;t handle the slight (slick) curve on the highway and the huge load of steel oil field pipe he was carrying just had so much momentum that it just pushed him to the left off the road and through the barrier. Thank God the road was lightly traveled and nobody in the eastbound lanes (including us) were hurt or worse.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We were only planning to drive about 300 miles or so each day so we made our way to the Pecos Rest Area on I-10. It&#8217;s a very nice, new, well lit and secure rest area with 24 hour security and surveillance cameras. It also a a great visitor center.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7014\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_141511-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>The Visitor Center inside the Pecos Rest Area<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Even though we had driven 311 miles, it was only about 1:00 pm so we grabbed a snack out of the fridge and continued east a total of 471 miles to the Sonora Rest Area where we will spend the night.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7015\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174820-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Our home for the night at the Sonoran Rest Area<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7016\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_174952-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>They have a lot of these nice picnic shelters at Pecos<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>There&#8217;s a little more highway noise here because we don&#8217;t have that nice big visitor center between us and the roadway.  But we&#8217;ll deal with it. Beggers can&#8217;t be choosers, right?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7017\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200303_102113-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>The on-board engine monitor<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>I&#8217;m happy with the way the rig is performing.  My Tire Pressure Monitoring System assures us that all the tires (including the one I took a chunk out of) are holding up well and we seem to be running somewhere between 7.5 and 8.0 miles per gallon average on our recent trips.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We&#8217;ve moved into the Central Time Zone and it&#8217;s a little after 8pm.  I still have to look at our trip tomorrow to see how far we might get and I need to reach out to our friend Dale in San Antonio to see whether or not he&#8217;s working tomorrow and if we might meet for coffee or lunch on our way through town.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For now .. take care and travel safe.  We&#8217;ll be in touch soon.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Were doing a lot better than this trucker we saw today. It was raining almost as soon as we pulled out of Deming, NM and still hasn&#8217;t totally stopped now in Sonora, TX. We came across this poor soul that I&#8217;m assuming just didn&#8217;t handle the slight (slick) curve on the highway and the huge &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/03\/03\/making-progress\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Making Progress<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554707329],"tags":[554707500,554707863,554707861,554707862,554707474],"class_list":["post-7018","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-traveling","tag-florida","tag-fort-stockton","tag-i-10","tag-sonora","tag-texas"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7018","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7018"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7018\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7019,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7018\/revisions\/7019"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7018"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7018"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7018"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}